WEBVTT

00:00.959 --> 00:02.460
In the year 845,

00:03.420 --> 00:04.713
the Colossal Titan

00:04.796 --> 00:08.425
and the Armored Titan suddenly appeared.

00:09.384 --> 00:12.804
They destroyed one of humanity's walls
and everyday life with it.

00:16.057 --> 00:18.518
Humanity abandoned Wall Maria,

00:19.227 --> 00:22.230
lost twenty percent of its population
and a third of its territory,

00:22.981 --> 00:26.651
and was forced to retreat
behind Wall Rose.

00:29.529 --> 00:32.782
In the year 850, in Trost District,

00:33.992 --> 00:37.454
humanity let the Titans
advance once again.

00:38.997 --> 00:42.083
And Eren Jaeger,
who had fallen prey to one,

00:43.126 --> 00:47.005
came out from a mysterious Titan.

02:26.521 --> 02:28.064
I'll ask one more time!

02:28.148 --> 02:30.108
What are you exactly?

02:31.067 --> 02:32.318
I'm a human!

02:37.198 --> 02:38.408
I see.

02:39.576 --> 02:40.827
Don't take this personally.

02:47.333 --> 02:48.251
Marco.

02:48.334 --> 02:49.794
I can't do this anymore.

02:50.378 --> 02:52.589
I can't fight the Titans anymore!

02:52.672 --> 02:54.132
What has gotten into you?

02:54.215 --> 02:56.259
My friends got eaten right in front of me!

02:56.342 --> 03:00.805
My friends got killed, yet I didn't feel
any sadness or hate at all!

03:01.681 --> 03:05.184
Deep down, I just felt glad it wasn't me.

03:06.352 --> 03:08.229
But it will be my turn next.

03:09.063 --> 03:11.566
I've realized what our job is.

03:11.733 --> 03:15.653
We need to keep fighting
until we eventually get eaten!

03:16.571 --> 03:18.156
Well, screw that!

03:18.239 --> 03:19.157
I'd rather end things now.

03:19.240 --> 03:21.284
Stop! Pull yourself together!

03:21.409 --> 03:23.286
You aren't the only one, you know!

03:23.369 --> 03:25.204
We're all fighting back fear!

03:26.164 --> 03:27.373
Just look at Sasha!

03:27.457 --> 03:31.628
Even after what she went through,
she's still an outstanding soldier!

03:34.631 --> 03:35.840
My stomach hurts.

03:35.924 --> 03:38.301
Could you please consider me
one of the wounded?

03:39.969 --> 03:41.888
- I can't go on!
- Stop!

03:41.971 --> 03:43.306
Stop it!

03:44.307 --> 03:46.935
That gag order is definitely warranted.

03:47.936 --> 03:49.771
The situation is bad enough as it is.

03:50.355 --> 03:51.773
If they found out about Eren...

04:00.156 --> 04:01.199
Cannon fire?

04:01.324 --> 04:02.742
Why only one shot?

04:02.951 --> 04:04.661
Look! Smoke!

04:04.744 --> 04:06.204
It's inside the wall!

04:06.704 --> 04:09.374
- Hey!
- What's happening?

04:09.916 --> 04:11.334
What's going on?

04:11.417 --> 04:13.253
Did they break through the water gate?

04:13.336 --> 04:15.838
Impossible!
That's the sturdiest place of all!

04:15.922 --> 04:18.049
They must have just set off a shell
by accident!

04:18.132 --> 04:19.467
Still,

04:19.550 --> 04:21.386
why is there so much smoke?

04:22.679 --> 04:24.681
No way. Is it Titan Steam?

04:26.599 --> 04:28.226
Hey!

04:28.893 --> 04:29.727
Hey!

04:52.292 --> 04:54.794
What the hell?

05:16.441 --> 05:17.900
It's alive!

05:17.984 --> 05:19.402
Captain Woermann!

05:23.239 --> 05:26.659
Wait and see what it does!
We can't risk getting near it!

05:26.743 --> 05:30.288
Stay on alert, everyone!
Remain on standby!

05:30.371 --> 05:32.498
Artillerymen, reload the cannon!

06:05.281 --> 06:06.991
What is this?

06:09.869 --> 06:12.580
I remember hearing the cannon go off.

06:12.914 --> 06:16.501
After that came a tremendous
sound, shock, and heat!

06:16.584 --> 06:19.504
And now we're inside a giant skeleton--

06:19.587 --> 06:21.214
Eren protected us.

06:22.048 --> 06:24.425
That's all we need to understand for now.

06:28.304 --> 06:30.681
Flowers, only on the inside?

06:32.016 --> 06:32.850
Hey!

06:34.227 --> 06:35.937
Are you guys all right?

06:36.479 --> 06:38.439
Eren! What is this?

06:38.523 --> 06:39.524
I don't know!

06:39.607 --> 06:43.444
But it's already starting to vaporize,
just like a Titan's corpse!

06:43.528 --> 06:44.695
Let's get away from it!

06:46.531 --> 06:49.283
I can't tell if they're watching
and waiting, or if they're in a daze.

06:49.992 --> 06:52.537
The Garrison Regiment isn't showing
any signs of activity for now.

06:55.039 --> 06:57.375
But I'm sure that soon enough,
they will start to attack again.

06:59.877 --> 07:03.381
I doubt there's any chance of reasoning
with them now, after seeing this.

07:04.215 --> 07:06.968
But there is one thing I remember now.

07:07.468 --> 07:08.761
The basement.

07:08.845 --> 07:10.638
The basement of my house!

07:11.180 --> 07:13.599
My dad said it would all make sense
if I go there!

07:14.976 --> 07:17.270
He's also the reason
this has happened to me.

07:18.187 --> 07:19.981
If I go to the basement,

07:21.023 --> 07:23.234
I might figure out
what the Titans are too!

07:27.280 --> 07:28.531
Damn it!

07:29.240 --> 07:30.867
Then why did he keep it a secret?

07:31.701 --> 07:36.789
Thousands of Scouts have died
trying to get that information!

07:36.873 --> 07:39.208
It's the only hope humanity has!

07:40.168 --> 07:43.838
And he just kept it tucked away
in our basement all this time?

07:44.505 --> 07:47.216
What the hell was he thinking?

07:50.428 --> 07:53.347
And where the hell
has he been these last five years--

07:53.431 --> 07:54.390
Eren.

07:55.266 --> 07:56.976
We have other things
to attend to right now.

07:58.644 --> 07:59.479
Right.

08:00.897 --> 08:02.148
The smoke is clearing!

08:02.231 --> 08:03.149
Attack on sight!

08:03.232 --> 08:04.358
Let's hurry and finish it off!

08:04.442 --> 08:06.194
Hold your positions!

08:17.455 --> 08:19.749
I'm getting out of here.

08:21.250 --> 08:24.462
- And where are you going? How?
- Anywhere will do for now.

08:24.545 --> 08:27.048
I'll jump over the wall
and make a go to the basement

08:27.715 --> 08:29.300
after I change into a Titan again.

08:30.176 --> 08:31.928
Can you really do that?

08:32.470 --> 08:35.181
I don't know how I can do it either.

08:35.640 --> 08:37.183
But I know I can do it!

08:38.226 --> 08:41.979
It's just like how I can't really explain
how I'm moving my arm.

08:44.190 --> 08:48.110
Just now, my mind unconsciously
focused on stopping the cannonball.

08:48.194 --> 08:52.615
That's why it decayed. It only had
the capabilities and endurance for that.

08:56.244 --> 08:58.871
Next time, I'm going to
be an even stronger one...

08:59.163 --> 09:01.207
I'm going to be a 15-meter titan

09:01.290 --> 09:03.000
that can slaughter other Titans,
like before!

09:03.084 --> 09:04.335
Eren!

09:04.627 --> 09:06.629
Your nose is bleeding.

09:08.881 --> 09:11.384
You look really pale,
and your breathing is rough.

09:11.717 --> 09:14.262
Something is clearly wrong!
You're not well!

09:15.346 --> 09:17.598
My health doesn't matter right now!

09:19.016 --> 09:20.768
I have two ideas in mind.

09:21.435 --> 09:25.773
You guys can get through this alive
if you stop trying to protect me.

09:27.358 --> 09:29.318
I've already caused you
enough trouble as it is,

09:30.528 --> 09:32.989
so I'm going to do at it alone
from here on out.

09:34.073 --> 09:35.491
You can't be serious.

09:35.575 --> 09:37.201
- I...
- Eren.

09:38.035 --> 09:39.036
I'm coming with you.

09:39.120 --> 09:40.329
No!

09:40.413 --> 09:43.374
If I keep up,
you won't have to worry about me.

09:43.833 --> 09:46.627
But I won't have to do
what you say either.

09:46.711 --> 09:49.046
I'm serious here! Just forget about it!

09:49.630 --> 09:52.717
I'm not your little brother or your kid!

09:55.261 --> 09:59.307
Sir, the cannon is almost reloaded.

09:59.390 --> 10:01.434
What are your next attack orders?

10:03.436 --> 10:05.021
You will wait for my signal!

10:06.147 --> 10:07.023
Yes, sir!

10:08.274 --> 10:10.192
For now, the Garrison Regiment
isn't showing any signs

10:10.276 --> 10:12.737
of launching a close-quarters assault.

10:13.738 --> 10:17.825
If they were, Mikasa would have
sensed it faster than a stray cat.

10:18.868 --> 10:21.537
Assuming they reload
in the shortest time possible, 

10:22.246 --> 10:24.081
it will take them about 20 more seconds.

10:24.540 --> 10:28.544
I figure Eren will spring into action
and be gone before then.

10:33.090 --> 10:36.594
Why am I reminded of that
at a time like this?

10:37.928 --> 10:42.099
Is it because this is the end for us?

10:43.225 --> 10:45.144
In the very end,

10:46.646 --> 10:49.982
I never became anything
more than a coward.

10:52.652 --> 10:54.987
They were always there
to help me so many times. 

10:55.613 --> 11:00.159
But not once did I ever manage
to give back the favor to them.

11:04.246 --> 11:08.876
How can I possibly call myself
their friend?

11:08.959 --> 11:13.089
How can I possibly offer to go with them?

11:13.172 --> 11:16.050
I'm not even confident I can keep up.

11:26.435 --> 11:29.271
I guess this is the last time

11:31.649 --> 11:35.903
that the three of us
will ever be together.

11:36.946 --> 11:38.030
Eren, I am--

11:38.114 --> 11:39.240
Wait, Mikasa!

11:39.824 --> 11:42.076
I said I had two ideas, remember?

11:43.452 --> 11:46.455
Armin, I leave the decision to you.

11:48.290 --> 11:49.375
What?

11:49.458 --> 11:53.671
Even I know how unrealistic this plan is.

11:53.754 --> 11:57.216
The best option would
be to use this Titan ability

11:57.299 --> 11:59.969
in a systematic way
under the military's direction.

12:02.012 --> 12:03.347
I know this sounds crazy,

12:04.432 --> 12:05.933
but if you think

12:06.225 --> 12:10.062
you can convince the Garrison Regiment
that I'm not a threat,

12:11.564 --> 12:13.816
I'll trust you and go with that option.

12:14.525 --> 12:16.318
That's my second idea.

12:17.486 --> 12:21.907
If you can't do it,
I'll escape from here as a last resort.

12:23.868 --> 12:25.619
Decide in 15 seconds.

12:26.370 --> 12:27.705
Can you do it or not?

12:28.289 --> 12:31.333
I'll respect whichever you decide on.

12:36.380 --> 12:37.339
Eren,

12:37.923 --> 12:41.177
why are you entrusting
such an important decision to me?

12:41.802 --> 12:46.640
Even when things get complicated,
you always make the right decision.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.560
I figure that's worth relying on.

12:50.728 --> 12:52.646
When did I ever do that?

12:52.730 --> 12:55.649
All the time.
Like that time five years ago...

12:55.983 --> 12:58.819
If you hadn't gone
and gotten Mr. Hannes for us,

12:59.570 --> 13:02.490
Mikasa and I would have been Titan food.

13:11.123 --> 13:12.541
It was all in my head.

13:13.459 --> 13:14.835
I convinced myself that's how I was.

13:17.254 --> 13:21.509
I convinced myself
I was helpless and a burden.

13:25.262 --> 13:28.807
But they never felt that way
about me at all!

13:28.891 --> 13:31.143
Armin! We're out of time!

13:34.063 --> 13:35.648
They have finished reloading, sir!

13:36.190 --> 13:37.274
We can fire at any time!

13:38.067 --> 13:40.986
These two who are willing
to place their lives in my hands

13:41.904 --> 13:45.866
are the people I trust
more than anyone in this world.

13:47.368 --> 13:51.455
What more do I need
to hear other than that?

13:55.209 --> 13:56.835
I will persuade them without fail.

13:57.419 --> 14:01.006
I'll need you to act
as nonaggressive as possible.

14:07.763 --> 14:12.560
Something has been bugging me
since Eren started fighting as a Titan.

14:12.643 --> 14:15.896
I haven't collected my thoughts yet,
but I'll do this!

14:15.980 --> 14:18.190
I'll have to think as I talk!

14:22.820 --> 14:24.113
Halt!

14:29.118 --> 14:31.745
You've finally revealed
your true form, monster!

14:31.829 --> 14:34.623
I'll do it! I'll give the signal to fire!

14:35.165 --> 14:37.668
He is not an enemy of humanity!

14:37.751 --> 14:42.006
We're willing to disclose
everything we've learned!

14:42.089 --> 14:44.341
Begging for your lives won't help you!

14:44.425 --> 14:48.178
He has revealed his true form for everyone
to see! What more is there to say?

14:48.262 --> 14:51.015
If you insist he's not our enemy,
then show me the proof!

14:51.098 --> 14:54.727
If you can't, then we'll simply eliminate
the threat he poses!

14:54.810 --> 14:56.604
There's no need for proof!

14:57.062 --> 14:59.815
That's right! There is no need!

15:00.190 --> 15:04.403
In fact, this isn't about
what we perceive him to be!

15:04.486 --> 15:05.696
What?

15:05.779 --> 15:08.616
I hear that countless people saw him!

15:08.699 --> 15:12.077
In that case, they surely saw him
fighting Titans as well!

15:12.161 --> 15:15.331
And they must have seen
the Titans swarming around him too!

15:16.874 --> 15:22.504
In other words, the Titans saw him
as prey just like how they see us!

15:22.588 --> 15:28.093
That's an irrefutable fact,
no matter how you look at it!

15:31.889 --> 15:33.349
He has a point.

15:33.682 --> 15:36.143
- A Titan, on our side?
- That's crazy!

15:45.444 --> 15:47.321
Prepare to attack!

15:47.446 --> 15:50.366
Don't be taken in by their clever ruses!

15:52.660 --> 15:55.621
Their behavior has always been
beyond our understanding!

15:55.704 --> 16:00.417
It's entirely possible they would take on
human form and use human language

16:00.501 --> 16:02.169
to deceive us all!

16:02.503 --> 16:05.589
We can't let them have their way anymore!

16:10.260 --> 16:11.512
It's no use.

16:11.595 --> 16:13.722
He has abandoned all logic.

16:14.932 --> 16:16.600
He's afraid to think.

16:18.727 --> 16:20.354
Eren! Mikasa!

16:30.823 --> 16:33.617
As a soldier,
I have long sworn to give my heart

16:33.742 --> 16:36.078
for the restoration of mankind!

16:36.203 --> 16:40.499
Nothing would make me happier
than to die for that cause!

16:41.041 --> 16:45.504
If we combine his Titan ability
with our own remaining manpower,

16:45.587 --> 16:48.882
we can retake this city!

16:49.133 --> 16:51.093
For humanity's glory,

16:51.176 --> 16:54.054
in what little time I have left to live,

16:54.138 --> 16:57.099
I will continue to advocate
for his strategic value!

17:01.562 --> 17:02.730
Captain Woermann.

17:03.439 --> 17:05.065
I believe his words
are worth considering--

17:05.149 --> 17:06.734
Silence!

17:08.318 --> 17:11.864
No matter how many times they beg
for their lives, they're still traitors.

17:11.947 --> 17:14.283
To dispose of those who violate the rules.

17:14.366 --> 17:16.744
That is the duty of a soldier!

17:21.165 --> 17:22.750
That's enough.

17:24.168 --> 17:28.297
I see you're still as weak
as a young deer despite your size.

17:30.466 --> 17:32.092
Commander Pyxis!

17:34.094 --> 17:37.097
Can you not see
that soldier's splendid salute?

17:40.350 --> 17:44.897
I've only just arrived,
but I've been filled in on the situation.

17:44.980 --> 17:46.774
You're in charge
of the reinforcements now.

17:47.524 --> 17:51.904
Something tells me we ought to hear
these people out, you see.

17:58.911 --> 18:01.413
According to the Scout Regiment's reports,

18:01.872 --> 18:04.291
it was believed that the Titans
would appear from the south.

18:05.292 --> 18:08.962
Indeed, it was Shiganshina District,
on the south side of Wall Maria,

18:09.046 --> 18:12.257
that the Titans attacked.

18:13.050 --> 18:17.930
As a result, the fortified city of Trost
on the south side of Wall Rose

18:18.430 --> 18:22.226
was deemed their next most likely target.

18:24.770 --> 18:27.064
TROST DISTRICT INSIDE DOOR

18:27.564 --> 18:29.066
Dot Pyxis,

18:29.817 --> 18:35.155
the top officer in charge of Trost
and the entire southern territory,

18:35.572 --> 18:37.908
and the man given full authority

18:37.991 --> 18:39.952
for the defense
of humanity's most vital region.

18:42.412 --> 18:44.581
No, none at all.

18:45.374 --> 18:49.128
I certainly wouldn't mind being
gobbled up by a beautiful female Titan.

18:50.212 --> 18:54.216
And he's also known
for being a full-blown eccentric.

18:55.092 --> 18:57.636
What is the Commander thinking?

18:57.719 --> 19:01.348
He is talking to those freaks
without a single bodyguard?

19:02.057 --> 19:07.229
I don't know. He's never been one
to make much sense.

19:07.312 --> 19:08.564
Sir.

19:09.606 --> 19:11.567
We've finished reassembling the troops.

19:11.650 --> 19:12.734
Right.

19:12.818 --> 19:13.819
Good work.

19:19.116 --> 19:20.242
I see.

19:20.534 --> 19:23.287
So visiting this basement
will make everything clear?

19:23.370 --> 19:25.706
Yes. Do you believe me?

19:26.498 --> 19:29.501
You can't provide proof for yourself,

19:29.585 --> 19:33.005
so for now,
I'm simply keeping it all in mind.

19:33.714 --> 19:38.135
But I do believe I can tell
when someone is sincere or not.

19:39.261 --> 19:42.139
I will personally guarantee your safety.

19:44.725 --> 19:47.519
Cadet Arlelt, was it?

19:47.811 --> 19:48.979
Yes, sir!

19:49.062 --> 19:52.816
Earlier, you mentioned that
with this so-called "Titan ability"

19:52.900 --> 19:55.736
it would be possible to retake this city.

19:56.195 --> 19:57.905
Do you truly believe that?

19:58.280 --> 20:01.158
Or was that just a desperate plea
for your life?

20:02.284 --> 20:03.577
Well...

20:04.745 --> 20:05.704
Both.

20:06.788 --> 20:08.916
I was going to suggest that Eren,

20:09.875 --> 20:13.045
in Titan form, could take that giant rock

20:13.128 --> 20:15.756
and use it to block the wrecked entrance.

20:17.132 --> 20:19.593
It was just an idea
I came up with on the spot.

20:20.886 --> 20:23.388
I just wanted them to see
the advantages of having Eren's ability

20:23.472 --> 20:26.350
and how it could help solve
the situation we're in.

20:30.395 --> 20:33.899
Of course, I was desperate to survive too!

20:35.317 --> 20:37.069
"Desperate to survive."

20:37.611 --> 20:39.780
There's nothing
more credible than those words.

20:49.081 --> 20:51.333
What do you say, Cadet Jaeger?

20:52.459 --> 20:53.502
Sir?

20:53.961 --> 20:56.630
Can you plug the hole?

20:58.674 --> 21:01.093
Well, about that...

21:01.885 --> 21:03.011
I'm not sure.

21:03.470 --> 21:08.392
Right now, I don't really understand
any more than the rest of you.

21:09.184 --> 21:11.561
Maybe I can. Maybe I can't. I don't know.

21:11.645 --> 21:15.649
I don't feel I can risk
giving an irresponsible answer.

21:15.732 --> 21:18.485
Oh, yes. My apologies.

21:18.568 --> 21:20.904
I asked the wrong question.

21:22.614 --> 21:25.742
Will you do it or not?

21:55.480 --> 21:56.565
I'll do it.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.443
I'll do it!

21:59.735 --> 22:02.321
I don't know
if I can plug the hole or not.

22:02.404 --> 22:03.280
But

22:04.239 --> 22:05.490
I'll do it!

23:44.047 --> 23:46.675
Despite having fled
out of fear once before,

23:46.758 --> 23:50.470
the soldiers choose to stand
on the battlefield again.

23:51.221 --> 23:52.639
Eren makes up his mind:

23:53.431 --> 23:54.766
"I'll be everyone's hope."
